          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: தீயணைப்பான்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தீயணைப்பான் — tīyaṇaippāṉ — \"a fire extinguisher\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சமையலறையில் தீப்பிடித்தால் அப்பா தீயணைப்பானைப் பயன்படுத்துவார். camaiyalaṟaiyil tīppiṭittāl appā tīyaṇaippāṉaip payaṉpaṭuttuvār. If the kitchen catches fire, Father will use the fire extinguisher."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தீ \"fire\" + அணைப்பான் \"that which puts out\", from அணை (aṇai)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தீயணைப்பான் (tīyaṇaippāṉ) is a modern native compound: தீ (tī), \"fire\" (DEDR 3266), and அணைப்பான் (aṇaippāṉ), \"that which puts out\", from அணை, \"to quench\" (DEDR 121)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
